### 実行例 (サブプロセス)

```python
run_skill_script(
    file_path="scripts/${script_module_name}.py",
    args={
        "input_json": "{\"param\": \"value\"}",
        "output_json": "/workspace/src/.workflow_tmp/output.json"
    }
)
```
